    {
      "source": "Return the transaction attribute for the given method,\nor <code>null</code> if the method is non-transactional.",
      "translation": "返回给定方法的事务属性，如果该方法非事务性，则返回 `<code>null</code>`。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Very simple implementation of TransactionAttributeSource which will always return\nthe same TransactionAttribute for all methods fed to it. The TransactionAttribute\nmay be specified, but will otherwise default to PROPAGATION_REQUIRED. This may be\nused in the cases where you want to use the same transaction attribute with all\nmethods being handled by a transaction interceptor.",
      "translation": "这是一个 `TransactionAttributeSource` 的非常简单实现，它将始终为传入的所有方法返回相同的 `TransactionAttribute`。可以指定 `TransactionAttribute`，否则默认为 `PROPAGATION_REQUIRED`。这可用于希望所有由事务拦截器处理的方法都使用相同的事务属性的情况。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Allows a transaction attribute to be specified, using the String form, for\nexample, \"PROPAGATION_REQUIRED\".",
      "translation": "允许使用字符串形式指定事务属性，例如\"PROPAGATION_REQUIRED\"。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>transactionAttribute</code> - the String form of the transactionAttribute to use.",
      "translation": "<code>transactionAttribute</code> - 要使用的 transactionAttribute 的字符串形式。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
